         </span>\n                        <button class=\"ps-version-download\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-1-3\">\n                            Baixar\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"ps-version-row\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-2\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-2-1\">\n                            1.0.44.9\n                        </strong>\n                        <span class=\"ps-version-date\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-2-2\">\n                            18/08/2026\n                        </span>\n                        <button class=\"ps-version-download\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-2-3\">\n                            Baixar\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
