d=\"1-1-2-1-4-5-3-2-2\">\n                                    22/07/2026 · 10:05\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card-actions\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-5-4\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-5-4-1\" href=\"#\">\n                                <svg data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-5-4-1-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                    <path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\">\n                                    </path>\n                                    <polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\">\n                                    </polyline>\n                                    <line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\">\n                                    </line>\n                                </svg>\n                                Download\n                            </a>\n                            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-5-4-2\">\n                                Detalhes\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"card\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-1\">\n                            <div class=\"app-icon-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-1-1\">\n                                <span class=\"app-monogram\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-1-1-1\">\n                                    F\n                                </span>\n                                <img alt=\"Logo FotoPlus\" class=\"app-icon-img\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-1-1-2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://plussoft.com.br/storage/images/programs/uj5Nt0w0PQ6QMx0cg3opG61QDZqnysgRH2SQqGve.png\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"app-info\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-1-2\">\n                                <h3 class=\"app-title\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-1-2-1\">\n                                    FotoPlus\n                                </h3>\n                                <div class=\"app-category\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-1-2-2\">\n                                    Ferramentas PlusSoft\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"status\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-1-3\">\n                                Atualizado\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-2\">\n                            Manipule imagens do cadastro de produtos integrado ao ShopControl9.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-3\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-3-1\">\n                                <div class=\"meta-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-3-1-1\">\n                                    Versão atual\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"meta-value\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-3-1-2\">\n                                    6.0.0\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-3-2\">\n                                <div class=\"meta-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-3-2-1\">\n                                    Atualizado em\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"meta-value\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-3-2-2\">\n                                    11/06/2026 · 13:20\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card-actions\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-4\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-4-1\" href=\"#\">\n                                <svg data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-4-1-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                    <path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\">\n                                    </path>\n                                    <polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\">\n                                    </polyline>\n                                    <line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\">\n                                    </line>\n                                </svg>\n                                Download\n                            </a>\n                            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4-6-4-2\">\n                                Detalhes\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"empty\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"no results message\" data-reason=\"displayed/hidden by script\" id=\"emptyState\">\n                    Nenhum programa encontrado nesta categoria.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <footer class=\"app-footer\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\">\n                <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\">\n                    PlusSoft © 2026. Todos os direitos reservados.\n                </p>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2\">\n                    Rua Antonio Marroquim, 529 Baixão Arapiraca / Alagoas\n                </p>\n            </footer>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"modal-overlay\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"details modal overlay\" data-reason=\"visibility toggled by script\" id=\"detailsModal\">\n        <div class=\"modal-content\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\">\n            <button class=\"modal-close\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" id=\"closeModal\">\n                ×\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"modal-header\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\">\n                <div class=\"modal-icon\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"modal icon container\" data-reason=\"content replaced by script\">\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\">\n                    <h3 data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"modal title text\" data-reason=\"content replaced by script\" id=\"modalTitle\">\n                        Título\n                    </h3>\n                    <span data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"modal category text\" data-reason=\"content replaced by script\" id=\"modalCategory\">\n                        Categoria\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"modal-body\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\">\n                <p data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"modal description text\" data-reason=\"content replaced by script\" id=\"modalDesc\">\n                    Histórico de versões\n                </p>\n                <div data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"modal version history container\" data-reason=\"children injected by script\" id=\"modalVersions\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
